  "id": "USN-8731-1",
  "summary": "miniupnpd vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that MiniUPnPd contained an integer underflow\nvulnerability in SOAPAction header parsing. A remote attacker could\nuse this issue to cause a denial of service or information disclosure\nby sending a malformed SOAPAction header with a single quote.",
